            "value": 35
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "concept-2",
      "term": "条件 GAN",
      "claim_type": "source_summary",
      "explanation": "生成器在条件 x 下产生输出，判别器比较生成输出与真实目标。第20页 d_φ 的数值语义与常见“真实概率”约定相反，必须按该页标签读公式。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec16-3886541007",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 17
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec16-3886541007",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 20
          }
        }
      ],
      "formula": {
        "status": "resolved",
        "latex": "d_\\phi^*=\\arg\\max_\\phi\\;\\mathbb{E}_{x,y}\\!\\left[\\log d_\\phi(g_\\theta(x))+\\log(1-d_\\phi(y))\\right]",
        "citation": {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec16-3886541007",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 20
          }
        },
        "warnings": [
          "第20页把生成样本标为 synthetic (0.9)、真实样本标为 real (0.1)，因此 d_φ 表示偏向 synthetic 的分数；这与常见的“输出为真实概率”约定相反。"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "concept-3",
      "term": "对抗损失加 L1",
      "claim_type": "source_summary",
      "explanation": "课件把 conditional GAN 目标与 λ 加权的 L1 项组合：对抗项针对输出结构，L1 针对成对目标的逐元素接近。页面关于稳定或收敛的表述属于该课程设置，不是普遍定理。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec16-3886541007",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 31
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec16-3886541007",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 35
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec16-3886541007",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 36
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec16-3886541007",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 37
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec16-3886541007",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 38
          }
        }
      ],
      "formula": {
        "status": "resolved",
        "latex": "g_\\theta^*=\\arg\\min_\\theta\\max_\\phi\\;\\mathcal{L}_{cGAN}(\\theta,\\phi)+\\lambda\\mathcal{L}_{L1}(\\theta)",
        "citation": {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec16-3886541007",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 31
          }
        },
        "warnings": [
          "“稳定训练/快速收敛”是页面对该组合的经验性陈述，不应改写为任意数据与实现上的保证。"
        ]
      }
    },
